sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Device Admin
    participant UI as Admin UI
    participant API as DevicesController
    participant Service as DeviceService
    participant DB as Gateway Database

    Admin->>UI: Register device alias
    UI->>API: POST /api/devices
    API->>Service: CreateAsync(displayName)
    Service->>Service: Generate device id
    Service->>Service: Set SubjectCommonName = pending-{id}
    Service->>Service: Set Status = Pending
    Service->>DB: Insert Device
    DB-->>Service: Saved pending device
    Service-->>API: DeviceDto
    API-->>UI: 201 Created

    Admin->>UI: Generate activation code
    UI->>API: POST /api/devices/{id}/activation-code
    API->>Service: GenerateActivationCodeAsync(id, validForMinutes)
    Service->>DB: Load device
    DB-->>Service: Pending device

    alt Device is pending
        Service->>Service: Generate random activation code
        Service->>Service: Hash "{deviceId}|{activationCode}"
        Service->>Service: Set expiry and clear used timestamp
        Service->>DB: Update ActivationCodeHash and ActivationCodeExpiresAt
        DB-->>Service: Saved activation code hash
        Service-->>API: ActivationCodeDto with plain code
        API-->>UI: 200 OK activation code
        UI-->>Admin: Display one-time code and expiry
    else Device is active or removed
        Service-->>API: InvalidOperationException
        API-->>UI: 400 Bad Request
        UI-->>Admin: Activation code rejected
    end
